window.products.push({"id":248004,"name":"WENFOME 4 Pieces Round Woven Placemats, 13.8 inch Plate Chargers Natural Wicker Placemats Water Hyacinth Straw Braided Tablemats Rattan Tablemats Rust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kQrzwJtaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 Round Woven Placemats, Natural Water Hyacinth Place mats, Braided Straw Table Mats for Dining Table (13.8 inch) Natural Water Hyacinth Weave Placemats sizes:Width: 35 cm (13.5 inches);Widely Used: Woven Placemats: Give your tablescape a natural flair with this set of 4 woven placemats. Hand-braided from 100% renewable water hyacinth, these decorative and functional placemats celebrate artisan handweaving traditions from around the world while beautifully accentuating your existing tableware.Table Decoration: Inspire your table with neutral tones and natural textures that complement or match a variety of interior design styles: coastal, rustic, boho, country or modern farmhouse.13.8inch Round Placemats: Tightly woven and big enough to fit cutlery, large plates, salad bowls, teapots, casserole dishes and crockery. Heat insulating properties allow the mats to safely support skillets, pots or pans.Protect Furniture: Tightly braided for thickness, durability, and temperature insulation with heat resistance up to 149 degrees Fahrenheit. Protect the tablecloth, tabletop, and other furniture from scuffs, scratches, spills, stains, and moisture damage. Easy to wipe clean with a damp cloth.Decorative and Functional: Use these stunning woven mats as dining table decor, kitchen counter top decor or hang on the walls for decoration. Place underneath vases, ornaments, potted houseplants, coffee makers, toasters or blenders to prevent a mess and add a touch of natural texture. Match any décor for bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining table and perfect display for Birthday party, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Halloween, wedding party and outdoor or indoor use meet your different needs.If you have any questions about this woven placemats, please consult us, we will give you an answer within 12 hours.If you need more styles table mats, our store has a variety of styles and colors, please click on the store name above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kQrzwJtaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WENFOME","source_asin":"B0B19TYQQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B19TYQQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B19TYQQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
