window.products.push({"id":248105,"name":"NORTH KAISER Metal Wall Art - Abstract Floral Design for Minimalist Home Decor - Metal Wall Hanging for Living Room, Bedroom or Bathroom - Aesthetic H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-SbkvkdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STUNNING & EMPOWERING ART: The metal minimalist wall art by North Kaiser is the perfect choice for those looking for a feminine and aesthetic piece of art. This simple yet elegant line drawing wall art features the image of a beautiful woman, describing the harmony of woman with flower. If those are the feelings you want to enhance, hang this on your living room, office and bedroom wall and see how it adds to your space and elevates your mood. LOOK PERFECT IN OUTDOOR & INDOOR: Beautiful minimalist metal decor like this female line art can be displayed anywhere in your home, office or apartment. Its striking and simple design blends well with any home decor or color scheme. Hang this art decor in any room using the screws we sent you and your guests will surely stand on their tracks and appreciate the elegant minimalist metal art. A GLAM GIFT IDEA : This women's art print is an ideal gift for any occasion or can make the perfect treat for yourself! Your daughter, sister, friend, mother or sister-in-law will love this as a room refresher gift on their birthday. Gift this black aesthetic wall decor to your girlfriends at their graduation, housewarming, Mother's Day, bridal shower or even as a Christmas present and see how this gift makes their space look stunning. SUPERIOR QUALITY & PACKAGING: Our aim is to create timeless art metal decors that have the life of a museum. We use paint that guarantees the superior quality of static powder coating paint, making metal wall decors resistant to fading and long-lasting. Woman flower metal wall art are carefully cnc machined from iron plates, then packed together with styrofoam foam to protect against breakage and bending, then shipped in kraft cartons to protect your artwork in transit. ORDER WITH CONFIDENCE & EXPECT HIGH QUALITY: We have absolute faith in the quality of our wall art. Our team carefully checked customer comments before leaving our workshop to maintain quality assurance. If there is any problem with your order, contact us and we will refund you or offer you a replacement. With us you always shop stress-free and risk-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-SbkvkdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTH KAISER","source_asin":"B0BGCRL2TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGCRL2TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGCRL2TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
