window.products.push({"id":248130,"name":"Bush Furniture Salinas L Shaped Desk with Hutch, 60W, Pure White and Shiplap Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":406.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+wuuQ67cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The L-shaped desk with drawers is not just any ordinary piece of furniture. It is a workspace powerhouse that maximizes productivity and organization. Its unique design offers ample surface area for working, as well as additional storage and shelving options for books, files, and other essentials. The shape itself allows for a natural division of tasks and functions, making it an ideal choice for multi-taskers who need to switch between computer work, paperwork, and other projects. Plus, the stylish and modern appearance of the home office desk adds a touch of elegance to any workspace, making it a must-have for home offices, executive suites, and corporate boardrooms alike. Whether you're a busy professional or a student in need of a versatile study space, the vintage office desk is a versatile and practical solution that will help you stay organized, focused, and inspired. Key features: The hutch features open storage with large compartments for books, binders, and decorations. The farmhouse office desk features a box drawer to store pens, paper, and other office utensils, as well as a file drawer gliding on smooth ball bearing slides for easy access to letter-sized documents. The timeless mission styling of the L shaped computer desk includes tapered leg accents, a charming finish, and contemporary metal hardware for an alluring appearance that matches your current decor. With a weight capacity of up to 200 pounds, the writing desk of our study desk provides a sturdy and reliable surface for you to work on, even when you have multiple materials and supplies within reach. This quality furniture comes with a 1 year manufacturer's warranty and meets ANSI/SOHO test standards for safety and performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+wuuQ67cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0C224KXDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C224KXDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C224KXDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
