window.products.push({"id":248163,"name":"3 Set Hanging Wall Baskets for Storage,Wire Baskets for Organizing,Wall Mount Wire Basket Shelf Organizing Decor for Bedroom Farmhouse Kitchen Bathroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vno9mR-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organizing the home is a time-consuming and laborious task, which is an annoyance for most mothers. Some frequently used items, frequently taken from the cabinet will increase a lot of labor. The wall-mounted storage basket makes every family more organized. Wall storage basket specifications: Material: stainless steel Color: industrial gray Quantity: 3 size:M Opening length: 15 in, width: 6 in Bottom length: 14in, width: 5.5 in Height: 3 in Installation method: sticky hook; non-marking nail; expansion bolt (all accessories are included in the package) Why choose them? Multifunctional wall mount storage basket The wire storage basket can be used in the kitchen, bathroom, office, garage, bedroom, entrance; used to store fruits, vegetables, food, snacks, spice bottles, documents, magazines, cosmetics, facial cleanser, shampoo, conditioner, Tools etc. All-match wall decoration The wire basket shelf uses a neutral industrial gray, which can be matched with any style of decoration. Whether your home is retro style, modern style, minimalist style, European style, it can be perfectly decorated. It can also be used for RVs, apartments, and forest chalets for vacations. Multiple installation methods There are 3 ways to install the wall basket: 1. Hang the storage basket with sticky hooks, this way doesn't need to punch at all. 2. Use non-marking nails to hang the basket, this way is no obvious perforation. 3. Drill holes in the wall in advance, and then fix them with expansion bolts. This is the strongest installation method, but holes are required. 100% satisfaction guarantee We regard product quality and user satisfaction as the most important things. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will solve them for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vno9mR-0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SICHEN","source_asin":"B098BJZ54C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098BJZ54C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098BJZ54C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
