window.products.push({"id":248185,"name":"oneinmil Bookcase, Triple Wide 5-Tier Open Bookcase, Wood and Metal Industrial Bookshelf, Etagere Bookshelves for Home/Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Aj2NI1C9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-usage Storage Space: Features with 14 open shelves, this Triple Wide large display shelf can maximize the vertical storage space while keeping your daily essentials in organizing. Overall size: 62.2''W x 11.81'' D x 64.37''H Vintage Industrial Design: Made of solid MDF boards and stylish matte black iron brackets, the industrial color makes this display rack well match your other furniture. As a bookshelf, room divider, and display shelf, this 5-tier large open bookcase is perfect for the living room, bedroom, den, and office DIY Available: In order to maximize the use of space, you can adjust the shelves of the bookcase according to your needs. This triple-wide bookcase is ideal for showing books, family photos, collectibles, and more Sturdy & Durable: Supported by the stable and durable iron frame, which provides more load capacity, 70lbs/shelf. The adjustable bottom feet and X-shaped brackets can keep the balance and stability of the bookshelf. Tipover Resistance Device prevents the bookshelf from toppling or wobbling Easy to Assemble: Send in two boxes. We provide all labeled pieces, tools, and instructions. You will find it easy to assemble this industrial shelf unit. Please reach out to the customer service team if you got any questions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Aj2NI1C9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"oneinmil","source_asin":"B0B8D7BP44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8D7BP44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8D7BP44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248186,"name":"Plush Extra Thick Mattress Topper Queen for Softening Firm Mattress, Breathable Cooling Mattress Pillow Top Bed Topper for Back Pain & Sleep Comfort, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lj3LQKrEL._AC_.jpg","description":"***** THE PERFECT ADDITION TO A FIRM MATTRESS. Generously filled with 153oz super soft down alternative gel-fiber, this queen size mattress topper is TRULY EXTRA THICK and offers the ultimate in softness to provide cloud-like sleep comfort to your body during the night. With its exceptional loftiness and plushness, this plump mattress topper is the perfect addition to a firm mattress. *****BEST REPLACEMENT FOR MEMORY FOAM OR FEATHER-DOWN MATTRESS TOPPER: Featuring breathable down alternative gel-fiber filling and skin-friendly soft brushed polyester fabric, this mattress topper is a great solution for people who are sensitive to feather-down mattress toppers or suffering from the odors or the heat retaining of a memory foam mattress topper. No more sweaty night with a memory foam mattress topper. *****ULTRA COMFORTABLE PILLOW TOP MATTRESS TOPPER FOR BACK PAIN RELIEF: The generously filled and evenly distributed gel-fiber filling adds an layer of extra thick cushion on your mattress delivering instant relaxation and providing best relief and support to shoulders, back, and hips. It is ideal for side, back or stomach sleepers and can greatly relieve the back pain. It's great for Mother's Day gift. *****SECURE FIT & BOX QUILTING CONSTRUCTION. Our mattress topper with 4 corner elastic straps adapts to mattress depths from 6\" to 22\" and ensures a secure fit to allow you toss and turn freely. The box quilting construction prevents the fillings from shifting as you sleep to offer you the most consistent comfort. *****TIPS FOR USE. It is not necessary to wash your pillow top before use as it is clean. For best results, tumble dry it on a low heat before use to fluff up the fibers. To extend your bed topper’s life and reduce the need to wash it, position a mattress protector/ fitted sheet over it. Wash bi-annually in a front loader machine on a cool wash. *Please do not use a top loader machine as the agitators destroy the fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lj3LQKrEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D & G THE DUCK AND GOOSE CO","source_asin":"B09XH8WB87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XH8WB87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XH8WB87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
