window.products.push({"id":248228,"name":"Ebros Set of 3 Whimsical Namaste Meditating Yoga Skeletons Trio Figurines 5.5\" Tall Ossuary Macabre Halloween Skeleton Zen Buddha Vastu Statues","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWzxnqZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether it be Halloween or Day Of The Dead, these yoga skeletons are fun decors to have and display. Every skeleton is acting out different poses and mudras fundamental to the practice of Yoga Meditation. Add some Fall leaves or colors to spruce up the scene for fall festivities or combine elements of the graveyard like spider webs, candles and the like to these yoga skeletons. They will be a great conversation starter at any party you host! Each of these yoga skeletons measure 5.5\" High 6.25\" Wide and 3.5\" Deep approximately. Together they weigh about 1.25 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LWzxnqZBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebros Gift","source_asin":"B08148RH5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08148RH5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08148RH5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248229,"name":"HOMICHEF 9.5 Inch Nickel Free Stainless Steel Saute Pan With Lid Induction Oven Safe - Premium Mirror Polished Copper Band Stainless Steel Pan With Gl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619xL1-S1nL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT APPEARANCE & PREMIUM QUALITY 1. This French style 9.5\" wide 2.5 quart saute pan is noble and elegant: mirror polished body with copper band at bottom, matte polished interior with 3\" straight side, tempered glass lid with steam vent.2. Compatible with gas, induction, ceramic, glass and halogen stovetops; oven safe. NICKEL FREE HARM FREE HEALTHY COOKWARE 1. Made of food grade Japanese standard JYH21CT (21/0) nickel free stainless steel: non-toxic, non-allergic, more energy savings.2. Nickel free SS is not only healthier, but also more heat-conductive hence more energy savings (12-15%). COATING FREE HARM FREE HEALTHY COOKWARE 1. General nonstick coating releases toxic fumes when cooking. This pan does not apply any coating. Its thick, finely polished, undeformable base eliminates hotspots for natural stick resistance.2. The best solution to nonstick cookware is seasoning pans at home. It takes just minutes to do. Detailed instructions are included in product package. VALUE ADDED ENGINEERING FEATURES 1. 5MM thick 3-Ply construction in the base (one layer of pure aluminum core sandwiched between two stainless steel layers) ensures optimal thermal transmission.2. Exterior copper band at bottom combines superior culinary performance with classic beauty; offers fast and even heat conductivity, thoroughly from exterior to interior. DEVOTED CUSTOMER SERVICE 1. Genuine HOMICHEF stainless steel cookware products, certified by ISO9001, BSCI, etc.2. This product comes with 1-MONTH full refund trial period & LIFE-TIME Customer Service.3. You can always come to us for discounted parts, cooking consultations, and customer service at HOMICHEF store on Amazon.Discover the GOURMET CHEF IN YOU with this HEALTHY & BEAUTIFUL & EFFICIENT saute pan :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619xL1-S1nL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B07DLM3KRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DLM3KRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DLM3KRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
