window.products.push({"id":248282,"name":"Nisaki Sateen Cotton King-Sheets-Sets Frost Grey, 100% Long Staple Cotton Bedding Sets King, Sateen Sheet Set Cool & Breathable Deep-Pocket Sheets fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dk4nXHTyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL & COMFORTABLE: The sateen sheet set is made from the finest pure long staple cotton featuring a 200 Thread Count. The 100% cotton Sateen weave gives you the feel of satin sans the excessive shine. With our Innovative Production Technique enjoy natural coolness of cotton with high breathability & beauty. The sheets are cosy and help to relax & rejuvenate your body. Enjoy more Thread Surface, thanks to the Special Single Dent weaving pattern which result to comfortable use all year long. STYLISH & GREAT FIT: Meticulously crafted 100% long staple cotton sheet set. The fray resistant set is elegance personified, thanks to the 4” hem on flat sheet & pillowcase. Extra deep pocket with 15” corner & strong all-around elastic offer a close fit to your mattress along with smart side indicator for ease of use. The oversized flat sheet is easy to tuck under the mattress. King Top Sheet: 108”x102” Fully elasticized fitted sheet with deep pocket: 78”x 80”+15. 2 King Pillowcases 20”x40” AFFORDABLE COTTON SATEEN: The long staple cotton fabric is breathable, making it perfect if you want to upgrade to cotton. Unlike their microfibre and cotton blend counterparts, these sheets are super absorbent, durable & become better in terms of comfort with use. The moisture-wicking feature that keeps away sweat at night. Made from Fade Resistant Dyes, but the use of bleach or creams containing bleaching agent may cause color loss. Machine wash warm on gentle cycle, tumble dry low. Each product passes through industry-leading stringent quality checks. The sheets are tested and certified in our in-house laboratory. Being a BSCI member, effective and well-established system is used to improve the working conditions in our supply chain. The Certified Cotton Logo guarantees that we use only sustainably sourced natural 100% long staple cotton. OEKO-TEX Certification ensures that our products offer maximum consumer safety and high-quality standards. GUARANTEE & GIFT: We take pride in the quality of our offerings and are confident about it and hence, offer a satisfaction guarantee on our products. If unsatisfied, please contact us and we’ll help you to have a hassle-free shopping experience. These reasonable sheet sets are a perfect gifting idea for various occasions. Delight your family and friends by gifting this sheet set on birthdays, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas and on any other happy occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dk4nXHTyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NISAKI","source_asin":"B09T711LR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T711LR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T711LR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
