window.products.push({"id":248312,"name":"LLB Genuine Sheepskin Area Rug Wool Rug Fur Carpet Fluffy Shaggy Fur Rug for Living Room Kids Bedroom Real Sheepskin Throw Lambskin Rugs Sofa Mat Chai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":198.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iVYDvsANL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Origin of Premium Sheepskin：Nature's finest home accents products which made of Australia Sheepskin，The wool is smooth, full and elastic, more warm and beautiful! Formaldehyde Free：2023 new eco-friendly unique tanning process，no formaldehyde, premium sheepskin to use more at ease Touched by Nature：LLB, the strict selection of materials, concern for the intimate contact between people and natural fibers, Promote natural life good life！ The Difference Between Genuine Wool and Fake Wool：When you touch real or fake wool, it feels completely different. Real wool has plenty of elasticity, feels smooth and warm to the touch, while fake wool has no elasticity, feels astringent to the touch and has a cold feel to the touch. The Difference Between Genuine Wool and Fake Wool：Real wool products are quite warm and do not produce static electricity. Fake wool products, not as warm as real wool, sometimes static electricity, and sometimes you can hear the \"hissing\" sound. Special Attention: Sheepskin products can not be washed, washing will lead to shrinkage deformation! As sheepskin products are natural materials, after washing need to go through professional fur treatment, in order to restore the best state of the product, so it is recommended to professional dry cleaners care, usually 1 year can be dry cleaned 1 time, if there is no obvious stains, it is recommended to use about 2 years before dry cleaning. Sheepskin Rug Daily Care：Simply shake out dirt and debris.And Regular vacuuming is ideal to remove dust and lint. If you spill something sticky or oily on sheepskin,quickly remove the excess and then spot clean the area with special wool liquid soap or alcohol and let dry naturally, out of direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iVYDvsANL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LLB","source_asin":"B09BYXZWC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BYXZWC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BYXZWC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
