window.products.push({"id":248407,"name":"2 Rolls Refrigerator Liners 17.71*59inch, Washable Fridge Mats Shelf Liners Waterproof Fridge Pads Drawer Table Mats Refrigerator Mats for Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SdqPHC4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reusable liners are a sustainable compromise. These are inexpensive and do an excellent job. If you buy these shelf liners, you won't need to waste money putting tin foil or paper towels on your shelves.They look pretty and they are so easy to rinse clean. These mats help keep your fridge clean. They stay pretty well. They fit nice in fridge. To adhere them to fridge you put water on the fridge shelf and then immediately placed them down to adhere them. They are easy to install, they keep the shelves clean and they give the refrigerator a bright new look.The raised disks on the back of the liners hold them in place. It can be cut to any size you need, can be used as a refrigerator mat, also dress up your book shelves, drawer,cabinets,shoe cabinets, counter top, dining table or even desk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SdqPHC4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mirokun","source_asin":"B09XFF8SPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFF8SPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XFF8SPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
