window.products.push({"id":248413,"name":"Roucarmantic 10PCs Dusty Roses Fake Roses Artificial Flowers Faux Roses with Stems for Home Decoration Wedding Bouquet Centerpieces Arrangement, Dusty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gIkYOLIyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifelike Artificial Roses: The rose petals are made of silk with natural color. Each rose comes with green stems of Eco-material and lifelike leaves. And you can find the rose thorns on the stems. It’s fake roses but realistic. Pack & Size: The package comes with 10 pcs roses with stems. The roses head is about 3.9 inch wide and total length of the roses is around 20.5 inch. NOTE: Reshape the Roses Head with a hair dryer will be a quick way. Holiday Guide Rosas: Rose is always right for the holiday gift. You can send the roses to your wife, girlfriend, lover, daughter, mom on Valentine’s Day, birthday, wedding anniversary or any other events. DIY Artificial Roses: You can use the roses with original long stems for deep vases or you can cut off parts for shallow vases. And the roses heads can be used separately for cake decor, flower background or other occasion. Multiple Occasion: As our customers suggest, these artificial roses can be used for wedding decoration, bridal bouquet, home decor, parties, centerpieces, baby shower, birthday events. We’d like to know more occasions usages from your sharing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gIkYOLIyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roucarmantic","source_asin":"B0B881NBCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B881NBCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B881NBCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248414,"name":"Thawing Plate Meat Defrosting Tray: Rapid Defrost Mat for Frozen Foods - Thaw Food Quickly & Safely","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y5g0wsI3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WORKS LIKE MAGIC Tired of waiting around for food to thaw? Or worse, realizing your forgot to defrost the meat in time, causing dinner to be delayed and guests or family members to go hungry. With OmniWire’s thawing plate, you can defrost frozen meats and more in half the time! No preheating or electricity is required - simply place frozen foods onto the tray and let the aluminum tray’s thermal conductivity take over. There’s no need for hot water either, which can ruin the meat’s original flavor as well as any rubs or spices you add. FAST & EFFICIENT While thawing times will vary depending on the size and thickness of the meat, food will still defrost much faster than it would at room temperature. And with zero exposure to chemicals or becoming partially cooked like with microwaving, a defrosting mat is the safer option, too. On average, frozen chicken breasts, steaks and pork chops will take anywhere from 60 to 120 minutes to fully defrost, with smaller things like burgers, sausages and bacon defrosting faster. Prepare meals faster and more efficiently! NON STICK BOARD OmniWire’s aluminum defrosting tray is an excellent conductor of heat but still stays cool to the touch for safety. It’s extremely durable and features a Teflon coating for extra protection and to prevent rusting. The non-stick surface stops foods from sticking and making it a huge hassle to wash. DURABLE EDGE GUARDS Rubber-like silicone edge guards are included to protect the corners of the mat. They also slightly raise the board off your countertop, allowing for better air circulation and conductivity. EASY TO CLEAN Rest assured cleanup is a breeze! OmniWire thawing plates can easily be rinsed and hand washed, and they’re also dishwasher safe for your convenience. Measuring W 11.5 x L 8 x H 0.5 inches with the corner inserts (0.06 inches without), the board is also compact enough for easy storage in any kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y5g0wsI3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OmniWire","source_asin":"B07CSRHGDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CSRHGDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CSRHGDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
