window.products.push({"id":248490,"name":"Ultra Fine Double Layer Pour Over Coffee Dripper- Food Grade 18/8 (304) Stainless Steel, With Handle and Cup Stand, Fits Most Mugs,Cups And Teapots","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619UekS-7LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"As the manufacturer, we comprehend your requirements about a reusable coffee dripper, we also have the technical capacity and facilities to make it come true. So we conduct a serious of experiments to get the ideal shape and the kind of the materials ( Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel). we also adopted double-layer design, what we do is to make your coffee tastes natural and original. I. There are many small holes at bottom of the cone, this design can make the pouring prtocess easier to control. II. The angel of the cone is 60 degrees, this design can help the hot water fully extract the essence of the ground coffee. III. The diameter of the bottom plate is 3.94”, it make the coffee dripper can fits nearly all of the cups and mugs. IV. This coffee dripper is made with 100% 304 food grade stainless steel, so it is easy to clean, friendly to the environment and dishwasher safe. V. Lifetime warranty and 100% refund guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619UekS-7LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iAesthete","source_asin":"B075M82YKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075M82YKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075M82YKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248491,"name":"Kate and Laurel Sylvie Teoitlan Valley Study Framed Canvas by Kate Aurelia Holloway, 18x24 Natural, Modern Abstract Statement Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816PSxHZ8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful portrait makes for a decorative and abstract piece of wall decor for your living room, entryway, bedroom, bathroom, or office. Light up your favorite living space with this print's broad strokes and symmetrical design, created with a muted color palette of reds, yellows, and greens. \"Teoitlan Valley Study\" derives from the artist's love and connection to nature and her exotic, adventurous travels. Dazzle your guests with this modern abstract art piece as a centerpiece for your next friendly get-together. It works beautifully as a decorative, warm statement piece for any space in your home. Print: \"Teoitlan Valley Study\" by Kate Aurelia Holloway. About the Artist: Kate Aurelia Holloway is a Boston-based artist with a passion for the outdoors, nature, and the sea. Her artistic passion stretches across multiple mediums, including paint, block-printing, pen and ink, and techniques. When creating her art, Holloway hopes to inspire the same happiness and peace she discovers while exploring and traveling the world. Her studio is located by the Atlantic Ocean, where she collaborates with other fellow artists and adventurers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816PSxHZ8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B0BB5GZ1CX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB5GZ1CX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB5GZ1CX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
