window.products.push({"id":248582,"name":"Organic Bamboo Straw with Cutlery Travel Case & Bag |Natural Reusable Eco Straw | Set of 8 Mix Large and Small Straws & a cleaning brush | Best for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lILQYmVmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We offer best bamboo straw set in town : Our set comes with 8 straws with a cleaning brush and cute cloth travel bag. We also give a biodegradable cutlery travel case as a bonus. You can put other eco-friendly utensils with our straws in our travel case and no need to carry them separately. Natural and safe: These straws are chemical and BPA free. Safe, reusable, biodegradable, natural drinking straws. Our straws are extremely strong and durable by nature, and contain NO inks or dyes. Not only do they look great, but they are practical too. They won't break when you drop them like glass straws and won’t pollute our planet like plastic straws. Bamboo over other materials: This bamboo is the perfect material and a great organic substitute to the plastic straw we're all used to. By using these reusable, biodegradable, plant based drinking straws you are helping the environment by reducing plastic waste. How to clean: Using the brush included in your package, clean the interior with warm soapy water. Then air dry on a dish rack. If, after using with strongly flavored drinks (like iced coffee,) a deeper clean is desirable, soak and shake in warm water and mild vinegar solution, or boil for 10 minutes with 1 part of vinegar to 20 parts of water. Avoid soaking your straws for hours, bamboo becomes soft and might bend. We do not recommend placing the straws in the dishwasher. Our support for your green move! We know changing lifestyle takes time. That’s why we offer a 100% money back guarantee within 30 days of purchase OR free replacement straws after that. If you're not completely satisfied, Just contact us directly and we will take care of you right away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lILQYmVmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Feel","source_asin":"B07JJKHT3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JJKHT3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JJKHT3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
