window.products.push({"id":248754,"name":"Futon Mattress Covers, Slipcovers, Bed Covering, 100% Cotton (Twin, Full, Queen) (Flower #11, Twin Splits 6 x 39 x 54 & 6 x 21 x 39)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jWpXjkiCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality fabric material - made in USA, 100% cotton, preshrunk. This futon cover gives your room a new emotional look with many beautiful and colorful flower styles . The colors are friendly matching with most of furniture decorations. This futon cover is used to protect a futon mattress lasting longer in life. Please make sure what size of futon mattress you have so that you are able to order a correct futon cover. Sometimes, your futon mattress has a special custom size, we are able to make the cover to be perfectly fitted. 1. Your futon mattress looks like a rectangular box - no attached or built in with the futon frame. 2. Measure the thickness of your futon mattress. 3. Measure the width. 4. Measure the length, this is the longest side from end to end. Currently we do have the following size available: Chair split: 28\" Wide x 54\" Long. Chair Ottoman: 21\" Wide x 28\" Long. Twin split: 39\" Wide x 54\" Long. Twin Ottoman: 21\" Wide x 39\" Long. Loveseat split: 54\" Wide x 54\" Long. Loveseat Ottoman: 21\" Wide x 54\" Long. Standard Twin: 39\" Wide x 75\" Long. Standard Full: 54\" Wide x 75\" Long. Standard Queen: 60\" Wide x 80\" Long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jWpXjkiCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D&D Futon Furniture","source_asin":"B0784LXTLM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0784LXTLM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0784LXTLM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248755,"name":"Tin Sign | Metal Wall Poster | Warning No Stupid People Beyond this Point 8 x 12 in. | Decoration Plaque for Business Home Bar Room Garage Garden Man ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ovz2ysUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for an awesome, high-quality metal sign for your bar, kitchen, or mancave? Look no further than our collection of metal tin signs! Our signs are made of eco-friendly, lightweight recycled metal and finished with durable, attractive paint. With a variety of designs to choose from, including bar signs, kitchen signs, music and bands signs, and pin-up style signs, there's something for everyone. Our signs are easy to handle and easy to hang, with rolled edges and stamped holes for hanging. You don't need a hammer and drill to hang these signs - simply use the pre-drilled holes to stick pins in the holes (when hanging on drywalls) or use double-sided tape to stick on the wall. Plus, our signs are lightweight so they will hold well with pins or double-sided tapes. Not only are our signs suitable for many places, such as bars, cafes, dining rooms, garages, beach houses, restaurants, hotels, kitchens, clubs, gardens, and more, but they also make great gift ideas for friends and family. And if you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase, we offer a no-risk, no-questions-asked money-back guarantee. So why wait? Add one of our metal tin signs to your collection today and enjoy the vintage charm and durability of these unique decorations!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ovz2ysUvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Forever USA","source_asin":"B08JPNG322","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JPNG322","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JPNG322","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248756,"name":"HyFanStr Adjustable Storage Rack Expandable Separator Shelf for Wardrobe, Cupboard, Bookcase Compartment Collecting (Length:20.8\"-35.4\", Width:16.5\", ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IOjOY7MmL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Package: 1 Storage Shelf (Single Sale) Design: Do not need screws to drill holes, the design of this storage shelf adopts the principle of tension and friction, so that it can firmly grasp the wall. It does the job extremely well. The shelf is divided into two parts, one side with several removable plates, the stretched part has no extra plates, which can hang clothes, towels and so on. TIPS: After installation. Please press the shelf with hands to test whether the rack is firm enough to grasp the wall. If it is not withstand firmly, please tighten the two micro-adjuster at the end of the shelf until it can not tighten any more. Home Storage Organizer: In Kitchen: organize and clean up all kitchen utensils, food, condiments and so on. Kitchens become clean and hygienic. In Bedroom: Make full use of wardrobe space, tidy up a big heap of clothes orderly. It is so easy and convenient to find clothes everyday. In Bathroom: Make full use of the space in the corner, towels and wash supplies are neatly placed. In Utility Room: cleaning tools storage, garden tools storage, garage storage. Different sizes can be stretched to different lengths. Please pay attention to the size options when buying. If you have any question during the installation, please contact us, we will help you to solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IOjOY7MmL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HyFanStr","source_asin":"B07RPTDSHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RPTDSHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RPTDSHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
