window.products.push({"id":248794,"name":"HIG 100% Microfiber Polyester Solid Sheets, White Queen Sheets Set - Super Soft, Warm, Breathable, Cooling, Wrinkle and Fade Resistant - Fits Mattress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131Sw3l5JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber Imported 【High Quality Microfiber】The bed sheet set is made of the high quality 288F microfiber fabric with the newest spinning techniques and double brush process, that makes this sheet set Stain Resistant, Warm, Breathable and Durable. At the same time it is softer and silkier than other products. Give you a great sleep experience every night. 【True Deep Pocket】Queen Size Luxury 4pc Bed Sheets Set includes: 1 flat sheet 104\"x92\", 1 fitted sheet 60\"x80\", 2 pillowcases 20\"x30\". Deep pocket that fit mattresses up to 16\" deep with elastic around the fitted sheet. These sheets grip and fit better than any other sheet set! Bed sheet set is designed to fit nearly all mattresses with a depth that does not exceed 16\". 【Color Variety & Nice Package】 Keeping the pace of the world’s fashion trend of bedding products, most popular colors are available for these solid sheet set. High transparent polybag with compact packing contributes a nice package look. For men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Those who love you will love this delicate gift. 【Easy Care】Our luxury sheets are resistant to fading, staining, shrinking, and wrinkles! They are machine washable in cold water and dry quickly on tumble! They are more durable than cotton sheets. Just throw them into the machine, you will have more time for rest and fun. 【Great Sheets For The Price】 These are some of the softest and most affordable sheets you’ll ever find. They are way softer than most Egyptian cotton sheets and at a fraction of the cost.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131Sw3l5JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIG","source_asin":"B07VT13TR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VT13TR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VT13TR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248795,"name":"AELS 3 Tier Boho Woven Hanging Fruit Baskets，Boho Fruit Basket with Tassel for Kitchen, Natural Rustic Macrame Wall Hanging Organizer, Stylish Corner ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sq0SU-sTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 3-tiered boho woven baskets with selected fringes from AELS are great for freeing up fridge space or keeping counter top clutter at bay. It offers ample space to keep fruits and veggies fresh and your household gadgets tidy and within reach. This organizer can be hang anywhere from the kitchen ceiling to the shower rod. Compared with the traditional wire fruit basket, the woven bottoms also prevent small fruits, like tiny grapes, from falling out. While serving as a great gathering spot for all your fresh fruit and vegetables, this hanging fruit basket also offers other uses: Hang it on a shower rod to keep your assortment of bottled shampoos, conditioners, lotions and bodywashes accessible. Or stash a collection of ornate ornaments in each basket. Then hang it on the ceiling to dazzle your guests with a beautiful holiday display. Can be used in multiple scenes -Kitchen: Fruits, veggies, potatoes, onions, ... -Living Room: Plant, flowers, small toys, keys, mails, ... -Bedroom: Makeups, fragrance, sunglasses, accessories, ... -Bathroom: Skin care products, towels, hair dryer, supplies, ...  -Anywhere else you need.   Dimension:  - Total length 31.5 \" - Top basket: D=6\", H=3\" - Middle basket: D=7.5, H=3\" - Bottom basket: D=11\", H=3\" Care Instructions: If the baskets are not even when received , the knods can be adjusted a little by manual regulation. If the tassels look unkempt and messy out of its packaging, groom them with a comb will make them normal. Spotted clean with wet towel. Do not Rub. Wash in cold water. Delicate Cycle, no bleach, no wring. Line dry in shade. After several washing and drying, it is normal that pure cotton material and pattern color might be dim. Sunlight will oxidize cotton fabrics and make the cotton fabric become dim and brittle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sq0SU-sTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AELS","source_asin":"B092RYH6JP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092RYH6JP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092RYH6JP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
