window.products.push({"id":248815,"name":"Aipoilk Heat Powered Wood Stove Fan Fireplace Fan for Wood Burner/Burning/Log Burner Fireplace & Stove, 5-Blade Christmas Tree Shaped Eco Wood Stove F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mFLzi5iLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Need to Sit So Close to the Fire Anymore!If you own a wood burner or multifuel burning stove ( freestanding stoves ), and would like to get more heat throughout your living space with no extra cost on electricity, all you have to do is get this amazing wood burner fireplace fan, create comforting heat faster and increase the efficiency of your stoves with a wood burning stove fan.Package Included1 x Heat Power Stove Fans + 1 x Red Gift Box + 1 x User Manual + 1 x HandleSpecificationGift Box Size: 8Lx6.5Wx5H(inch), G.W.: 0.83kg Fan Size: 5.4Lx3.9Wx7.25H(inch), Shape: Christmas Tree, Running RPM: 1700 RPM, Blade: 5, CFM: 310(Max.), Noise: 25dB, Min. Operating Temperature: 55°C(131°F), Max. Operating Temperature: 350°C(662°F), Material: Premium Anodized Aluminum, Installation position: on the left / right side of the furnace topHow To Use The Wood Stove Fan?No installation required. Just pull it out of the box and position the stove top fan on a smooth flat surface of your stove top, near the side or back of the stovepipe. DO NOT place the log burner fan in front of chimney pipe, too close to the chimney will reduce its performance, and even cause fan damage by overheat. Start automaticallyStart work when the surface temperature under the fan reaches around 55?(131?), working with a temperature between 55(131?) centigrade degree to 350(662?) centigrade degree. The higher temperature of the stove, the faster the blades spin. Slow down and stop as the stove cools.Kindly AttentionDO Not Touch! Never handle the base of the stove fan, do not set the stove fan down on an unprotected surface when hot. To move or carry the fan, always use the extendable handle while wearing gloves.Keep Away From Children! Please keep fan away from small children when in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mFLzi5iLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aipoilk","source_asin":"B09B75RQD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B75RQD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B75RQD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
