window.products.push({"id":248835,"name":"NANSTORY Cooling Weighted Throw Blanket for Kids, (Twin Size,36 inch x 48 inch, 5 lbs) 100% Soft Cotton with Premium Glass Beads, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tXmIYDDcS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"GUARANTEE COMFORT: NANSTORY blanket can be directly used alone. Its material is 100% cotton, soft and comfortable. Also you can use it with a sheet cover or with a duvet cover. IMPROVE YOUR SLEEP: NANSTORY blanket gives you the feeling of being hugged. It will bring you warm and comfortable feeling. Help you fall asleep faster and make you feel safer. SEWING TECHNOLOGY: It has a unique 7-layer structure to prevent the beads from leaking out. We sew the compartments of the blanket to a smaller size so that the weight of the blanket is evenly distributed and fits perfectly to the body. The new sewing technology reduce the occurrence of holes and leaking beads in the blanket. EASY-CARE: NANSTORY blanket can be machine washed gently in cold water and then air dried. It can also be dehydrated gently. Since the blankets are too heavy for a washing machine, we recommend you hand wash or use a sheet cover. The best way is using a sheet cover of the same size. The sheet cover is easy to clean and it can protect your blanket. HOW TO CHOOSE: We recommend choosing a blanket that weighs around 10-12% of your body weight. If the final weight falls equally between two blanket sizes, it’s best to go with the lighter option.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tXmIYDDcS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NS NANSTORY","source_asin":"B094972WC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094972WC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094972WC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
