window.products.push({"id":248909,"name":"birdyboutique.com Bright Flowers Yes You Can Motivational Tapestry Wall Hanging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZHAviwilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Important daily reminder to everyone, that yes you can! This colorful tapestry has vivid colors and super crisp outlines for a clear view of the motivational quote \"Yes You Can.\" What a great way to encourage and motivate your kids and adults every day! Hang it up in a hallway, a study room, bedroom or a classroom. The tapestry comes with very thin pins/nails that can be used to hang it up; sturdy support and no wall damage. This tapestry is bright and fun and is sure to get your child's attention. Machine washable on cold, delicate; hang to dry. Caring for your tapestry is easy, simply throw it in the dryer to release the wrinkles or better yet, hang it up and use a steamer! Use the included push pins by positioning them where you'd like to hang it, and hammering in the flat pin that is sticking out, which will push out the sharp pin into the wall. Alternatively, you can use cute clothes pins or other clips to hang on clotheslines, art boards or walls. Co-owner Joanna Serra, a former educator, worked with her team to create several different tapestries for Birdy Boutique. Research shows that hands-on activities greatly enhance retention and learning. Sometimes learning activities can seem too rote. We wanted to create the perfect combination of education, fun, ease and comfort. When you can combine something that kids love and use with fun facts, then it takes learning to a more natural place where it doesn't feel like they are studying! Being able to lay down on the floor or sit on the couch with your child in a relaxed environment will likely provide a less stressful learning scenario. Casually presenting information to kids while at home, at the park, in the car, or wherever you take your tapestry will foster many fun learning moments in the near future!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZHAviwilL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"birdyboutique.com","source_asin":"B09CQ14XYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQ14XYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQ14XYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248910,"name":"Slitree Apple Peeler, 3 in 1 Apple Pear Corer Slicer Peeler Stainless Steel Blades Durable Heavy Duty Hand-Cranking Apple Peeler Apple Pie Fruit Veget","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174I+P2z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN ARTIFACT - peel, slice and core your apples, potatoes in one motion! OPERATE STEPS 1. Suck the apple peeler on the kitchen countertop or other smooth surface and make sure it sucked stably. 2. Loosen the screw guide on the handle end of the machine and pull the handle back completely. 3. Place the stems of apple or potato etc. on the three-prong, spiral mandrel and press them to approximately 1/8 inch. 4. Spin the handle continuously to peel, slice, core the apple simultaneously. 5. Take off the fruit and enjoy it! PEEL, SLICE AND CORE, MULTIFUNCTIONAL 3 IN 1 APPLE PEELER PEELING: Adjust the peeling blade to remove as little or as much peel as you choose, and get the corer slicer blade away from the apple, turn the handle to peel your apple, an apple without peel appear. CORING + SLICING: Get down the peeler blade, align the round knife of corer with the apple core, press the base with your left hand and turn the handle with your right hand, spiral apple ring with peel appear. CORING + SLICING + PEELING: Adjust the peeler blade to right point and align the round knife of corer with the apple core, press the base with your left hand and turn the handle with your right hand, a spiral apple ring made in 5 seconds. WHAT CAN YOU DO WITH APPLE SLICES? APPLE CINNAMON CIRCLESCut your peeled, sliced & cored apples just once to create circles. You can use them to make perfect apple cinnamon rings. APPLE PIESGive your apples 2 cuts if you want to create semicircles. These will work great if you want to bake a perfect apple pie. DRIED APPLE SLICESSlice your apples in smaller chunks if you would like to make dried apple slices. It can be used to peel/core/slice fruits and vegetables, dehydrated apples, apple cobbler, or to make fruit pies, salad, canned products and every exotic dish you can think of! START YOUR MAGICAL KITCHEN JOURNEY NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174I+P2z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slitree","source_asin":"B08ZH4ZHKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZH4ZHKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZH4ZHKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
