window.products.push({"id":248959,"name":"Plush Triangular Headboard Pillow Day Bed Back Wedge Pillow, Large Bolster Reading Back Rest Pillow with Shredded Foam Insert, Daybed Backrest Positio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":97.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wyz6BwdEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Let It Inflate More Than 72 Hours] When the package is opened, the headboard pillow will be deformed and thin due to compression packaging. Please wait for 72 hours, the wedge pillow will be restored to its original thickness and shape! If you want to recover the thickness (height) quickly, please shake and pat the pillow, or expose it to the sun [Luxury Fluffy Plush] Compared to other headboard wedge pillows, this headboard cushion is more comfortable and softer. This backrest positioning support pillow is made of thick fuzzy plush material, long daybed pillow has good comfort and can relax your head, neck, lumbar, and back. A large headboard bed pillow will also help you get better sleep and keep you full of energy throughout the day [Better Support] Filler: Shredded memory foam and silk cotton, rather than traditional PP cotton filling. The bed rest headboard pillow is filled with 60% shredded memory foam and 40% silk cotton. The mixed filling is moderately soft and hard, shredded memory foam has a good rebound effect, and silk cotton is fluffy and comfortable [Washable Zippered Design] There is a metal zipper at the bottom of the headboard backrest, the zipper is very long, removing and putting in the pillow filler is a breeze, and the furry body pillow cover can be put in the washing machine to wash, so the day bed bolster pillow is easy to clean and durable [Size: Twin] 39x8x20 inches. This headboard pillow is available in five sizes. The large bed bolsters pillow is suitable for daybeds, bunk beds, queen beds, and king beds. Other small headboard cushions can be used as a bed pillow in kid's rooms or dorms, a support lumbar pillow for the sofa bed, a wall near the window, or can be used for reading and relaxation. It can easily support your head, shoulders, back, and waist, allowing you to enjoy the best relaxation and comfort while resting [Note: Regain The Thickness] The daybed pillow is transported in a compression bag. Please gently tap the pillow after receiving it, then the headboard support pillow will recover to the normal thickness soon. Package: 1 x headboard cushion","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wyz6BwdEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMAX","source_asin":"B09W53R3K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W53R3K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W53R3K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":248960,"name":"Dad: A Son's First Hero - Mom: a Son's First Love - 11-Ounce White Sublimation Ceramic Coffee Parents Mug Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Goq33cw2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our CustomGiftsNow sublimation ceramic mugs are heated up to 500-degrees Fahrenheit. The image is then heated directly onto the ceramic coffee mug and then dipped into a water solution to ensure lasting image quality on the side shown. The image/design is applied to our ceramic mugs in our warehouse located in the United States (USA) to ensure higher quality assurance. Will make a great present as a reveal to a new dad and mom. If you can't visit your loved ones these mugs can be a surprise arrival as a pregnancy announcement to your family. These mugs will create a unique and memorable moment every morning they drink tea, coffee or any other favorite beverage. Can be used in the microwave to heat up tea or water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Goq33cw2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CustomGiftsNow","source_asin":"B07BHVYPTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-248960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHVYPTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHVYPTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
